					"nextDialogs": [
						750040302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040302,
					"content": "唔，这样问题就能得到解决了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040303,
					"content": "嗯…我来试试…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040304,
					"content": "快，快把我们一起封印进去——就像说好的那样——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040305,
					"content": "咝—然后离开，离开——你们为什么还不离开——灾厄——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040306,
					"content": "仔细听，不只有…那下面不只有两位士兵说话的声音。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040307,
					"content": "从那发光纹路的背后，从那痛苦的嘶吼更为遥远之处…\\n你听到有人在怒吼，你听到有龙在忍痛低吟。\\n你听到血肉交融至一处的声音，和话语无法形容的黏腻巨物缓缓向前行进的脚步。\\n但你也听到，仿佛有千万只手，千万只手在不断抗拒，在向外推搡…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040308,
					"content": "你听到你听到你听到…在狭小的黑暗里，那是一场永远无法停息的战斗。\\n那是一场…持续到永恒终结之时的折磨。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040309,
						750040310
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040309,
					"content": "他们无法获得安息…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040311,
					"content": "呜！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040312,
					"content": "那些英雄们，他们直到今日也在不停战斗…为了不让深渊从「镌光铭印」之后涌出。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040313,
					"content": "我叙说那些故事是有意义的，我们一直铭记着这些勇士的牺牲，不忘记他们的所有付出。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040314,
					"content": "…可是，可是这份痛苦太沉重了。这跟故事不一样，故事里我们说：「英雄们受了伤，抖了抖身子，就跟没事人一样站了起来。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040315,
					"content": "但是，真正的受伤，真正的折磨不是那样轻松的东西…他们一直在承受那样巨大的痛苦，在那狭小无光的世界，承受了那么多年。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040316,
					"content": "呜！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040317,
					"content": "怎么会这样，我们就不能做些什么吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040318,
					"content": "我…我也想为他们做些什么，可是，那可是深渊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040319,
					"content": "也许唯一能做的就是继承他们的意志，重新将「镌光铭印」封上…在部族的故事里，「缝影针」并不是第一次掉落。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040320,
					"content": "从前肯定也有人到这里，从前也有人…看到过陶奥鲁的碑文。那些修复「镌光铭印」的人，一定也看到了我们看到的那些。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040321,
					"content": "但是…部族里的故事没有更改过。因为故事里的警告是真实的警告，危险也是真实的危险。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040322,
					"content": "我们只能修复完「镌光铭印」，然后离开，我们只能…铭记一切，不遗忘在这里看到的任何事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040323,
					"content": "可是…呜，可是他们明明是英雄，却要一直在这里受折磨…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040324,
					"content": "派蒙说得对。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040325
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040325,
					"content": "英雄不该落得这样的结局。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040326
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040326,
					"content": "我知道，我也想让那些仍然受苦的战士们得到安息，可是…我没有那样的力量，我、我只是个叙事人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040327,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040328,
					"content": "唔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040329,
						750040330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040329,
					"content": "没关系，我们有力量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040331
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040331,
					"content": "#…{NICKNAME}，真的吗，你们真的愿意帮忙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040332,
					"content": "#嗯，我就知道{NICKNAME}一定会愿意出手。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040333
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040333,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040334
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040334,
					"content": "#深渊可是很危险的…不过，我这么说并不是质疑{NICKNAME}的实力，只是…不希望你们勉强自己。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040335
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040335,
					"content": "没关系，对付深渊，我们可谓是经验丰富啦。而且，不是还有那个「镌光铭印」在嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040336
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040336,
					"content": "嗯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040337
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040337,
					"content": "唉，你们比我想象的还要了不起。你们愿意为解决他人的痛苦而付出自己的力量，真的，真的是很了不起的英雄。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040338
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040338,
					"content": "#对，我是叙事人…我要记录下英雄的故事。异邦而来的英雄{NICKNAME}啊，请务必…请务必让我看看你们战胜深渊的英姿吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040339
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040339,
					"content": "嗯，一定能赢的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040340
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040340,
					"content": "那么…要现在解开「镌光铭印」吗，还是，再做一些准备？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040341,
						750040343
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040341,
					"content": "现在就解开吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040342
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040342,
					"content": "#好的，{NICKNAME}，祝你…不，是希望你能够成功！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040343,
					"content": "稍等，再做些准备。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040344
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040344,
					"content": "#好的，尽可能做些准备吧…小心一些，{NICKNAME}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040330,
					"content": "重新书写一下故事的结局吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040331
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040310,
					"content": "他们仍然在战斗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040311
					]
				}
			]
		},
